    "body": "> Reviewed commit: `330df7bc3cdc407817a7f1badc13fd9774e2b7d6`\n\nThis PR aims to optimize Timer and HR Tiles for vertical space density, which is a valuable frontend improvement. The visible changes in the diff primarily involve the deletion of `.cache/.tsbuildinfo-typecheck` and Playwright VRT snapshots. The removal of old VRT snapshots is an expected and positive step when UI changes are introduced, as new snapshots will need to be generated to reflect the updated layout.\n\nSince the core UI changes are not fully visible in the provided diff, it's crucial to ensure that the new layout for the Timer and HR Tiles achieves the intended vertical space density without compromising readability or user experience. Visual verification of these changes across different screen sizes is essential.\n\nPer `docs/DESIGN_GUIDELINES.md` (Automated Accessibility Testing), it's also important to confirm that the automated accessibility checks pass for the updated components to maintain WCAG 2.1 AA compliance.\n\n> Reviewed at commit: `330df7bc3cdc407817a7f1badc13fd9774e2b7d6`\n",
